<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.guest.stands ~ the guest stands by an operator act, never by the boot

`lares mempalace setup` raises the guest standalone (`mempalace init`) and pins `hooks.auto_save=false`. The guest serves as a comparator baseline, so the vessel's boot never stands it. The lane law: `lares mempalace` touches only the guest `~/.mempalace` comparator; `lares sense` touches only the sovereign sensorium.

<<~/ahu>>

